    "body": "The default jobs threshold is `1` so the module gets rendered if the jobs count is **greater or equal** than the threshold. If you want to display it with zero background jobs correct threshold would be `0` not `-1`. It will OFC fail because the current implementation does not allow `0` threshold but the right way forward isn't allowing a negative threshold but a zero one.\r\n\r\n/cc @Anthuang Please update your PR to reflect this.",
